---
description: When editing Docker, env, health, or the migrate job, follow the configure-runtime skill.
globs:
  - "Dockerfile"
  - "docker-compose.yml"
  - "Makefile"
  - ".env.example"
  - "cmd/migrate/**"
  - "internal/config/**/*.go"
  - "internal/platform/health/**/*.go"
  - "internal/platform/postgres/**/*.go"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the `configure-runtime` skill. `DATABASE_URL` is required. Migrate, then start the API. `/healthz` does not ping the database. `/readyz` does.
